{"2922510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gloomfall", "steam_appid": 2922510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/9d7e0d6628abe92c89ff63e2d8cf137c.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/9d7e0d6628abe92c89ff63e2d8cf137c.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/9d7e0d6628abe92c89ff63e2d8cf137c.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through portals into unique procedurally generated worlds. It's up to you what you're going to do next - Loot abandoned buildings, defeat enemies, complete quests, or maybe run to the nearest portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/7a39945767b689c0e62195d83d74cbd8.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/7a39945767b689c0e62195d83d74cbd8.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/7a39945767b689c0e62195d83d74cbd8.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your gear, level up, unlock new skills and choose your own playstyle! Want to sneak? Take a dagger and light shoes. Want to fight? Grab a sword, shield and heave armor, or something for ranged combat. Maybe want to be a mage? It's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUESTS &amp; CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/0278a4c50f5bb9eff2d45ac294a8b55c.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/0278a4c50f5bb9eff2d45ac294a8b55c.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/0278a4c50f5bb9eff2d45ac294a8b55c.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are looking for an even bigger challenge, take a risk and compete with the strongest creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/b69f28cbbdafb904c4e1e649252e7660.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/b69f28cbbdafb904c4e1e649252e7660.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/b69f28cbbdafb904c4e1e649252e7660.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an exausting journey, go back to your camp and rest. If you have enough resources, place an alchemy table or workshop and start crafting new gear!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/9d7e0d6628abe92c89ff63e2d8cf137c.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/9d7e0d6628abe92c89ff63e2d8cf137c.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/9d7e0d6628abe92c89ff63e2d8cf137c.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through portals into unique procedurally generated worlds. It's up to you what you're going to do next - Loot abandoned buildings, defeat enemies, complete quests, or maybe run to the nearest portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/7a39945767b689c0e62195d83d74cbd8.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/7a39945767b689c0e62195d83d74cbd8.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/7a39945767b689c0e62195d83d74cbd8.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your gear, level up, unlock new skills and choose your own playstyle! Want to sneak? Take a dagger and light shoes. Want to fight? Grab a sword, shield and heave armor, or something for ranged combat. Maybe want to be a mage? It's up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUESTS &amp; CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/0278a4c50f5bb9eff2d45ac294a8b55c.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/0278a4c50f5bb9eff2d45ac294a8b55c.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/0278a4c50f5bb9eff2d45ac294a8b55c.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are looking for an even bigger challenge, take a risk and compete with the strongest creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/b69f28cbbdafb904c4e1e649252e7660.poster.avif?t=1776277209\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/b69f28cbbdafb904c4e1e649252e7660.webm?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/b69f28cbbdafb904c4e1e649252e7660.mp4?t=1776277209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an exausting journey, go back to your camp and rest. If you have enough resources, place an alchemy table or workshop and start crafting new gear!</p>", "short_description": "Gloomfall is a dark fantasy Roguelike game. Explore a diverse, procedurally generated open world, unlock unique skills, fight, complete objectives, craft, and trade.. Become the strongest hero, by defeating the most powerful forces of evil in each region.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/header.jpg?t=1776277209", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/83a86a5fedf1495b8b88546d7a2fab139a58b08f/capsul